  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f29464cbe55079ab45b12d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了振兴汤驹温泉乡，我们要进行源泉的挖掘！\\n进行训练或参加比赛时，挖掘会自动推进。\\n此外，<color=#ff9900>旅馆等级</color>会根据完成挖掘的源泉数量而提升！\\n<color=#ff9900>旅馆等级</color>会影响共举办3次的<color=#ff9900>沐浴会</color>的结果。\\n不断推进挖掘，提升<color=#ff9900>旅馆等级</color>吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c596c8534584e33b5717a1dc537f22d2bec32c74e3058fa4719a69c3ddbc9b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "315"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39355d01a7d2c4221e55413",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开始挖掘前，要选择作为挖掘对象的源泉。\\n源泉由「沙」、「土」、「岩」3种<color=#ff9900>地层</color>构成，\\n并使用对应各地层的<color=#ff9900>挖掘装备</color>进行挖掘。\\n选择源泉时，可以强化装备，提升挖掘效率！\\n确认源泉的地层，进行装备强化吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "004c8683b2bf15ccbc59c0015ef10117f6dcb3ae9a626341f9f881b1f1486efe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "316"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e43e316b39dd74f506320c25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各指令推进的挖掘量是固定的，但在训练时\\n会根据<color=#ff9900>「一同训练的角色人数」</color>\\n追加挖掘量！\\n选择训练时，也请注意挖掘量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d46545c52340e80d35b964573b9765ce315c34288a548a2f3bd1a1b74b8fa587",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "317"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b3d0867a3af71c80e7c44c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随着挖掘的进度，每个地层都能获得不同的基础能力。\\n但是，挖掘会比平时的训练或比赛消耗更多体力，\\n选择指令时请注意体力管理！\\n此外，完成挖掘时，有时也能获得<color=#ff9900>入浴券</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c423d447a8c53b8c1aad799380c0cf76a61f09ab6d1803ea8b23b96e5bb0a2c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "318"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a1e1118a6b7857790d50b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开始挖掘前，要选择作为挖掘对象的源泉。\\n源泉由「沙」、「土」、「岩」3种<color=#ff9900>地层</color>构成，\\n并使用对应各地层的<color=#ff9900>挖掘装备</color>进行挖掘。\\n选择源泉时，可以强化装备，提升挖掘效率！\\n确认源泉的地层，进行装备强化吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "004c8683b2bf15ccbc59c0015ef10117f6dcb3ae9a626341f9f881b1f1486efe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55818a08644f2ea1d8472710",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可观看已获得<color=#ff9900>乐曲</color>的LIVE演出。\\n从育成赛马娘及已获得的服装中选择主唱和伴舞，\\n用自己喜欢的组合来进行LIVE。\\n若标有<color=#ff9900>「歌唱」</color>图标，则可听到此赛马娘的歌声。\\n乐曲可通过主线故事或育成等获取。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92848d2bc9bf2504b4c7b0c039e60712971a64173c5a6b0aff3577652268f02e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbc9606119a8adae53e058b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开始挖掘前，要选择作为挖掘对象的源泉。\\n源泉由「沙」、「土」、「岩」3种<color=#ff9900>地层</color>构成，\\n并使用对应各地层的<color=#ff9900>挖掘装备</color>进行挖掘。\\n选择源泉时，可以强化装备，提升挖掘效率！\\n确认源泉的地层，进行装备强化吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "004c8683b2bf15ccbc59c0015ef10117f6dcb3ae9a626341f9f881b1f1486efe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "320"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a9109811e77f5c4c9addbfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "沐浴会结束后会发现新的源泉，\\n再次选择要挖掘的源泉吧！\\n从之后追加的源泉中获取强大的<color=#ff9900>温泉能量</color>吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7cc32a15dea0b3341a50da16ac05f3111f92f68c07ffb24eba74addeadf2332",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eff6159327ac46f432f16ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开始挖掘前，要选择作为挖掘对象的源泉。\\n源泉由「沙」、「土」、「岩」3种<color=#ff9900>地层</color>构成，\\n并使用对应各地层的<color=#ff9900>挖掘装备</color>进行挖掘。\\n选择源泉时，可以强化装备，提升挖掘效率！\\n确认源泉的地层，进行装备强化吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "004c8683b2bf15ccbc59c0015ef10117f6dcb3ae9a626341f9f881b1f1486efe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:183737bd3a2e0f78c60155c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "挖掘量会受到名为<color=#ff9900>挖掘力</color>的加成影响。\\n每个地层都有<color=#ff9900>挖掘力</color>，其数值会根据「育成赛马娘的基础能力」、\\n「基础能力因子」、「挖掘装备的等级」而变动。\\n强化装备或选择源泉时，\\n也请确认<color=#ff9900>挖掘力</color>后再做选择！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53161c6c942a3dbdbb7769ac0d914ae92a0273706a83d5cd6efd749d61666c3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "323"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e605799d7cd1eb941304d98a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "沐浴会结束后会发现新的源泉，\\n再次选择要挖掘的源泉吧！\\n从之后追加的源泉中获取强大的<color=#ff9900>温泉能量</color>吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7cc32a15dea0b3341a50da16ac05f3111f92f68c07ffb24eba74addeadf2332",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "324"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04e567a9fed89114946448dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各指令推进的挖掘量是固定的，但在训练时\\n会根据<color=#ff9900>「一同训练的角色人数」</color>\\n追加挖掘量！\\n选择训练时，也请注意挖掘量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d46545c52340e80d35b964573b9765ce315c34288a548a2f3bd1a1b74b8fa587",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2854c28e4ba07102c0534c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行<color=#ff9900>宣传活动</color>可推进挖掘并获得基础能力。\\n挖掘量会和训练一样，根据一同进行<color=#ff9900>宣传活动</color>的\\n<color=#ff9900>「温泉伙伴」</color>的人数而变化。\\n此外，每进行1次<color=#ff9900>宣传活动</color>即可获得1张<color=#ff9900>入浴券</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21f3436095187c9df60dc66135918603ddf7996733e94d55ac26785952b1c9d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ae2809af3c9d7054506ecc5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "夏季集训期间无法进行<color=#ff9900>挖掘</color>和<color=#ff9900>宣传活动</color>。\\n但可以发动<color=#ff9900>温泉能量</color>，所以请注意<color=#ff9900>入浴券</color>的数量！\\n活用<color=#ff9900>温泉能量</color>来高效地进行夏季集训吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7626ff0dd51c3c08c32e6146dcd61bf0c49fd00a4805bb07127594f9a61d625f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "327"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac6d8ca70fa661c2c9a25d3c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "夏季集训期间无法进行<color=#ff9900>挖掘</color>和<color=#ff9900>宣传活动</color>。\\n但可以发动<color=#ff9900>温泉能量</color>，所以请注意<color=#ff9900>入浴券</color>的数量！\\n活用<color=#ff9900>温泉能量</color>来高效地进行夏季集训吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7626ff0dd51c3c08c32e6146dcd61bf0c49fd00a4805bb07127594f9a61d625f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "328"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a646fd51f316179a16553e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>解放结晶</color>可以使用于可进行性能解锁的支援卡。\\n 交换获得的支援卡会自动进行<color=#ff9900>性能解锁</color>。\\n无法适用于未持有的支援卡或已达到最大性能解锁的支援卡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1fe6b59c362497f65754dc811cda4b85c2c517fc2bc1b1277898829321dde81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eb9329ce4e1196872cd9f03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以进行训练员信息的确认和设置。\\n<color=#ff9900>生日</color>时可以在主页收到赛马娘的祝福，\\n改变<color=#ff9900>性別</color>的话部分剧本会发生改变。\\n（性别可以随时更改）",
      "source_fingerprint": "da6f539ae981318b071e0d0b4b038fcdc37eedf5d9fd8ca225326181cab1b827",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3925eb844801327514549ba5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘扭蛋</color>中，可获得育成赛马娘和碎片。\\n若抽到<color=#ff9900>已经拥有的育成赛马娘</color>，\\n则会转换为<color=#ff9900>与其★数相应的女神像</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb5369f6ff9d8dbc2df1090301559ff72bf335b0fae4ff232243d7ba18f548f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "330"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91d1da4ee021f9114b7c727d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>支援卡扭蛋</color>中，可获得支援卡。\\n若抽到<color=#ff9900>已经拥有的支援卡</color>，\\n会自动进行<color=#ff9900>性能解锁</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bda7608ba68f12a9eeb5eaed41347491ffe7abd6cdb6c3db63de6d76ac54846",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f87afc5b2de8f526754b989",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "源泉有各种功效，完成挖掘即可强化\\n<color=#ff9900>温泉能量</color>！\\n<color=#ff9900>温泉能量</color>可使用<color=#ff9900>入浴券</color>入浴来发动！\\n此外，当体力消耗较多时，会触发<color=#ff9900>「超回复」</color>，\\n能<color=#ff9900>恢复超过体力上限的体力</color>，并获得属性值！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5ef1a31e802dc50cd7f4018007ac22f9ae5f2257718c06ebc43f8edf4f29b80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "332"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5777a37d50b019d22b4b625",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在此育成剧本中可使用<color=#ff9900>自动育成</color>。\\n从育成主页的[自动]按钮选择方案并开始后，\\n系统将自动进行育成所需的操作。\\n也可以编辑各个方案的详情。\\n活用<color=#ff9900>自动育成</color>，轻松享受育成的乐趣吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c36ae7789f563f6f7a078cb5a8b57935ee254f2698d40635b55a9a2420a9b313",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "333"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434d82abd1f9594c53de282b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在本育成剧本中，各育成赛马娘没有各自的特定目标，\\n而是将<color=#ff911c>称霸BC比赛</color>作为共同目标！\\n挑战BC比赛的机会仅有<color=#ff911c>古马级11月前半的1次</color>。\\n请与远征项目『DREAMS』的成员们\\n互相砥砺、共同成长，以称霸BC比赛为目标前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fb0ec2a5a88868a573f1809bab2cfde88a73ac4f7e6e54c7d22723afcb7774f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "334"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9c34cf94f12eeb501c7ea05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以称霸BC为目标，与<color=#ff911c>团队成员</color>共同开展活动。通过与成员们进行多次训练来增强团队实力。<color=#ff911c>团队整体的实力也会影响BC的胜负</color>，因此请积极地与成员们一起训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eda1af55feda84ae970f93cd70fb6caa1f575bc97f6724fa9000e40680674cfc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "335"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc789c9bb4bbef61a04368e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff911c>战术会议</color>中，可以强化3种<color=#ff911c>队伍参数的等级</color>。强化队伍参数后，<color=#ff911c>发动DREAMS训练时的效果也会随之增强</color>！强化队伍参数需要消耗<color=#ff911c>DP</color>。请注意，一旦消耗了DP将<color=#ff911c>无法重新分配</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a80e3adf1b55e12fdd67e7ba796b413f6eae7626037a8237b33a69c12fd95477",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "336"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff5eb3b9d07dd84e86b9b8d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在夏合宿期间，<color=#ff911c>每回合开始时成员都会获得梦想槽</color>。由于此时成员提升评价的机会将大大增加，请在关注<color=#ff911c>梦想槽</color>状态的同时迎接夏合宿吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea5694b23fb1b2f5d1da48c63e6a439695803b65e63130df306ad8163dc478a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "337"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ff6898a9d7189395a3994a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以确认或设置训练员信息。在<color=#ff9900>生日</color>当天，可以在主页收到赛马娘们的祝福，更改<color=#ff9900>性别</color>也会使部分剧本内容发生变化。（性别可随时更改）",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0bd21a81516c0b359e965cd51bb99c488f9cb698d67fde5474b535a7d89b2cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "338"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c6a80fd5507aa666d5ef844",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过设置<color=#ff9900>代表赛马娘</color>和<color=#ff9900>支援卡</color>，可以帮助关注者的育成。根据次日的被租借次数，可以获得<color=#ff9900>训练员奖章</color>和<color=#ff9900>好友Pt</color>。（奖励将发放至礼物盒）",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f0ba68efb2bcbb233e27828389f4d48ac04cab93acd23c65b258c9449112ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "339"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a8f17a8234aa831c075fc0a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过设置<color=#ff9900>代表赛马娘</color>和<color=#ff9900>支援卡</color>，\\n可以为粉丝的育成提供帮助。\\n根据帮助次数可在<color=#ff9900>次日获得友情点数</color>。\\n（发送至礼物盒）",
      "source_fingerprint": "1713cd7e250dc2143a63618eefb4cf59281b9e2d18942eb6c58a4b4979cfbc4f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269802be1283af15a8b05164",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已<color=#ff9900>关注</color>好友的代表赛马娘和支援卡将会出现在育成的各个列表中供你选择。此外，帮助<color=#ff9900>互相关注</color>的好友进行育成，可以获得更多好友Pt。如果关注者较少，可以尝试从<color=#ff9900>推荐</color>中寻找。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1294ffe3c68507bb4d80c6a9d0145f66a1a418f1619636a8d61de69bb10b64c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "340"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ab7c98f4d80e135e2e0a53d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以制作属于自己的<color=#ff9900>原创名片</color>，并将名片（图片）<color=#ff9900>在社交媒体分享</color>。除了训练员信息外，还可以<color=#ff9900>自定义显示</color>心仪的赛马娘、支援卡以及相片等图像。",
      "source_fingerprint": "953fb7bc4568323dcca6933cae358bfb60fc6b612c4b40a0323c8c510ea294c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdaeee3eb2a8a1e6c5844f50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关于代表赛马娘持有的<color=#ff9900>因子信息</color>，以及<color=#ff9900>主代表以外的赛马娘与育成支援卡</color>，也可以<color=#ff9900>在社交媒体分享</color>。通过名片功能展示你引以为傲的赛马娘吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a059253041b55dede12c38a90be173f99d9e1e0c471703a503e44c8466353398",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "342"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c009aa217c86411160200ff2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>继承专用赛马娘</color>可以<color=#ff9900>每日最多批量获得10人</color>。与育成相同，根据支援卡的编组以及出赛的比赛，可以使其持有各种因子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc59c80f44b17cdd762f270e8be393bfe4ae47adaff760bc9c346e61647d20e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "343"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d2d174cc5adaf587b67f08f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "执行<color=#ff9900>「批量获得」</color>后，<color=#ff9900>继承专用赛马娘</color>将会被保存。继承专用赛马娘虽然无法参加团队竞技场和各种比赛，但在育成时可以设置为继承赛马娘。为了培养更强大的赛马娘，请活用<color=#ff9900>继承专用赛马娘</color>吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe5a9fa3229e05d1eb41b07d4e106e6907365d6b79984d33e5d44477588cc65c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "344"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a93a90839a89b67d1afc6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "设置<color=#ff9900>优先因子</color>后，会更容易获得目标因子。优先因子<color=#ff9900>最多可设置10个</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "726f7ff398b6d1c0d23915819b94a1d8555223ea8db3daff236295f01e5e2409",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "345"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2c00dabc1d45b5cb6d51c74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "执行<color=#ff9900>「批量获得」</color>后，<color=#ff9900>继承专用赛马娘</color>将会被保存。继承专用赛马娘虽然无法参加团队竞技场和各种比赛，但在育成时可以设置为继承赛马娘。此外请注意，一旦将其移籍，该赛马娘将会消失且无法恢复。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3bdc4fc37b9b18fcdb13444c7d5478d268a769f02bdf99b2f950f41f484f313",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "346"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:668139449ce395195218e2f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在主舞台排名靠前时，可以获得对应排名的<color=#ff9900>限定称号</color>！在顶级比赛中胜出，以更高的排名为目标前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e762ba77dd5c5d98c44da1025d8494bebcf06d547d15b8d18e785cbdb781a0d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "347"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b557ae63bc95c5e0d43c9dd9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终排名在第1名至第96名的训练员，我们将为您邮寄<color=#ff9900>特别奖品</color>！活动结束后，符合条件的训练员主界面将显示申请用的横幅，请届时确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d5263ca2ddd0605afbed1b5ec173b86cda5edb5c285d558a9655e6278ed3332",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "348"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:487e8562c3298b7eb5443424",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过选择赛马娘并报名出赛获得分数，即可参加<color=#ff9900>各育成赛马娘排行榜</color>。参加排行榜来赢取<color=#ff9900>特别称号</color>吧！\n※仅能选择1名育成赛马娘报名排行榜。\n※在更改期限内仅可更改1次报名赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab43b8b1a46aa10ae1eb945760a349798541cdd02f1c6a0e79a48173d5bfca75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "349"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33749793f42cecf871d8bb2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>称号任务</color>或<color=#ff9900>活动</color>等可以获得称号。\\n已获得的称号随时都可以更改。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c33c9e642a57aa5347e06434cb8344deac4bf1cdb439caeaef02a29c4769e8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a46b889e565e0fc2750a407",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请选择作为<color=#ff911c>育成最终目标</color>的BC比赛。途中的目标比赛也会根据BC比赛自动决定。对于所有育成目标比赛都具备资质的选项，会显示<color=#ff911c>「推荐！」</color>。犹豫不决时，就从带有「推荐！」标识的选项中选择吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f197aedd34efe8ffbf511ac79b14eb1a81f1e82950a4e359fdefcea16acc16a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "350"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64e9078e60f299e891f591f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与成员一起训练时，<color=#ff911c>获得的属性会提升</color>，且成员会<color=#ff911c>获得梦想槽</color>。当梦想槽获得3次并达到<color=#ff911c>最大状态</color>后，再与其进行训练，<color=#ff911c>成员的评价就会提升！</color>请积极执行成员所在的训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b37afa02be77c5b235374903acf361ba16bf8157a15cd282221992759015ca3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266b8b10234f6e2ce508a04f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "队伍评价由成员中<color=#ff911c>评价最低的一位</color>决定。队伍评价提升后，可以获得<color=#ff911c>友情加成等</color>效果。由于队伍评价也是<color=#ff911c>总结</color>时的目标，请不要偏向特定成员，努力提升<color=#ff911c>全体成员的评价</color>吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d1dea086cc73bb11ef6ad7c119e1786b71dbbadbd6f076801f6fac48b57d9ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "352"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be20b0c8ad2af21ea763616b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随着育成进度，将可以发动<color=#ff911c>DREAMS训练</color>。发动DREAMS训练后，<color=#ff911c>3名成员以及编组支援卡中的最多5名成员，会同时出现在所有训练中</color>！由于可发动的次数有限，虽然在总结时会恢复次数，但请注意次数<color=#ff911c>不会超过上限</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a9b7765dfa216919881fcfe0d11a52e3151cb820da7fbfaa5563ab23f5b351",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "353"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be0a3b8c2969d4f07a33a05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在整个育成过程中，总共会举办5次<color=#ff911c>总结</color>。每次总结都设有<color=#ff911c>目标队伍评价</color>。若达成目标，则可以获得更多用于战术会议的<color=#ff911c>DP等奖励</color>，因此在育成时请时刻关注队伍评价！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8a04e6e6222c94a084d6a2b3ab1b7b4e0d29781b4ffc294936b2d68da142c99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "354"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9072961bfab96717911ec0fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff911c>战术会议</color>中，可以强化3种<color=#ff911c>队伍参数的等级</color>。强化队伍参数后，<color=#ff911c>发动DREAMS训练时的效果也会随之增强</color>！强化队伍参数需要消耗<color=#ff911c>DP</color>。请注意，一旦消耗了DP将<color=#ff911c>无法重新分配</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a80e3adf1b55e12fdd67e7ba796b413f6eae7626037a8237b33a69c12fd95477",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "355"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:598755bddec29b97319f4049",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在此育成剧本中可以使用<color=#ff911c>自动育成</color>。从育成界面的[自动]按钮选择计划并开始，系统将自动执行育成所需的操作。你也可以编辑各计划的详细内容。利用<color=#ff911c>自动育成</color>来轻松享受育成的乐趣吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3065f3beccb56eee03151d5a72d2d413145a25d3129551d9ee506b94074b4cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "356"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a003b60c2f09a9a64e19f04",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "练习中，可以<color=#ff9900>按任意条件</color>自由举办赛事。\\n不仅可以选自己培养的殿堂级赛马娘，\\n还能与<color=#ff9900>其他训练员的赛马娘一起</color>出赛。\\n最多可同时与18名赛马娘进行练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceacc0af68a2ea016dec56a348f870d676437adc6e47876e696a928f1600163e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "357"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:824b379811d4f47eacae0fd6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将团队竞技场或房间赛中看到感兴趣的赛马娘\\n注册为<color=#ff9900>练习伙伴</color>，\\n就能让她们一起参加比赛。\\n此外，也可以让已关注好友的代表赛马娘出赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58adb288ea4d6145f54cef0e4705d6312fda4eefa6a34c89b685ff10a02488f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "358"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e50f799105d451296cb51915",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以将引以为傲的<color=#ff9900>殿堂级赛马娘</color>在社团或SNS上<color=#ff9900>分享</color>。\\n与社团成员及好友积极互换注册练习伙伴，\\n让练习内容变得更加充实吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7285ac8da19ff85684d988e821e43b3a5c4a73e67eec071b8c52e249c8cbee24",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "359"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05134efc29261a727e9168b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "助力理事长的梦想，朝着全收集努力吧！\\n在育成中的重赏比赛或传奇比赛中\\n获胜后，可以获得<color=#ff9900>奖杯和报酬</color>。\\n另外，完成收集规定数量奖杯的任务后\\n可获得报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d637cbfc5d46ec2f29682dc27c396ab89299feba5379a10c044f0c3d8e5213b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d04f3064a30dcbf5d322c3c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将想要反复练习的赛马娘保存到<color=#ff9900>我的出赛列表</color>后，\\n在进行出赛注册时就能<color=#ff9900>迅速调用</color>！\\n练习结果界面也能进行保存，请多加利用。\\n若解除了练习伙伴关系，\\n该伙伴也会从出赛列表中移除，请注意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4ec3f6d4a631a3d835f1b8f6e438c4c374a33ee48c5415f10c3884f96c06e1f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "360"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f56189fcfa4d2ba3e9a57f25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练养成会预先决定训练方针及出赛赛程后开始，\\n并会<color=#ff9900>随时间推移而完成</color>。\\n※与常规养成不同，将以独特的机制进行训练及触发事件直至养成完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c8164f847ac8ecb45dfcdf73c2c1be56efc96a03e762f96d7f4f6e95798a13d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57d1b7b1883f55e12a03e348",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不仅可以在闲暇时间进行养成，\\n自主训练期间还可以回到首页看剧情，\\n或是游玩赛事内容等，<color=#ff9900>自由支配时间</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "224e726c2ba869ec4f01c654f277fef59d56a1b25ed90ef97696e9f6fbcd7ee3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "362"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc639ef5afeafc00d926fe0c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了协助各地赛事举办，并向应援的人们\\n通过拉面传达感谢吧！\\n一边训练一边研究各地的拉面，并在年末的\\n<color=#ff911c>拉面嘉年华</color>中让赛场热闹起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d80333a60bbe05f901e24ec93ff3f1792c4a8f309bfdf9b2545d49b9fce27e23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "363"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be4ce01cebfb09be42037c21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "选择未来一年要研究拉面的地区吧！\\n在<color=#ff911c>地区选择</color>中，<color=#ff911c>每年可选3个</color>地区进行拉面研究。\\n地区共有10处，每年可选的地区有所不同。\\n此外，各地区制作的拉面不同，制作时<color=#ff911c>产生的\\n效果也不同</color>，请确认后再进行选择！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf6e1557f26c9dcd76e945ceb6d0bf383c96371fb2ce7235cf75ab7946fe69da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "364"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25590fa884877a95cc127cff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为制作拉面，首先来学习拉面诀窍吧！\\n诀窍共有<color=#ff911c>3种</color>，<color=#ff911c>合计最多持有10个</color>。\\n拉面诀窍可通过<color=#ff911c>积攒对应槽</color>来获得。\\n习得槽<color=#ff911c>每回合固定增加</color>，<color=#ff911c>槽满后</color>\\n即可<color=#ff911c>获得1个对应诀窍</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a2655d105911573a16a16096bebe379fa4bef4748c76899d7992ea1db46195b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "365"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91e150313328880995541d45",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "组合各地区不同的诀窍，即可执行<color=#ff911c>试吃会</color>。\\n试吃会<color=#ff911c>随时可执行</color>，仅限当回合，\\n可发挥<color=#ff911c>训练强化等</color><color=#ff911c>各种效果</color>！\\n执行试吃会还可获得<color=#ff911c>热度Pt</color>，影响<color=#ff911c>RMJ的\\n热度</color>，请积极举办试吃会吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "198c60ff420976bfe4a32c733096298b9c6c244b205b8a0ca6ac04181a212abb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "366"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3021eb186448daac6bc126e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本养成剧本可使用<color=#ff911c>托管养成</color>功能。\\n在养成首页点击[托管]按钮选择方案后开始，\\n系统会自动进行养成所需操作。\\n也可以编辑各方案的详情。\\n活用<color=#ff911c>托管养成</color>来轻松享受养成乐趣吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "722a88ce1f072c1e1e278e39c1692228b8cd952196641b400876c72d70144353",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "367"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaf97542152583f05cd5db8d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "选择未来一年要研究拉面的地区吧！\\n在<color=#ff911c>地区选择</color>中，<color=#ff911c>每年可选3个</color>地区进行拉面研究。\\n地区共有10处，每年可选的地区有所不同。\\n此外，各地区制作的拉面不同，制作时<color=#ff911c>产生的\\n效果也不同</color>，请确认后再进行选择！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf6e1557f26c9dcd76e945ceb6d0bf383c96371fb2ce7235cf75ab7946fe69da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "368"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cdd9b1ab83babdf8bcc03ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "组合各地区不同的诀窍，即可执行<color=#ff911c>试吃会</color>。\\n试吃会<color=#ff911c>随时可执行</color>，仅限当回合，\\n可发挥<color=#ff911c>训练强化等</color><color=#ff911c>各种效果</color>！\\n执行试吃会还可获得<color=#ff911c>热度Pt</color>，影响<color=#ff911c>RMJ的\\n热度</color>，请积极举办试吃会吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "198c60ff420976bfe4a32c733096298b9c6c244b205b8a0ca6ac04181a212abb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "369"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2d5cd35302e6ff354b2817",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>关注</color>的好友的代表赛马娘和支援卡\\n可在育成里各自的列表中选择。\\n另外，帮助<color=#ff9900>互相关注</color>中的好友的育成\\n可以获得更多友情点数。\\n粉丝太少的话，去<color=#ff9900>推荐</color>里找找吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f21efefa57e8aa9ea13624d885d45bf4345fc9d131b91ee7e74588c06ba2b74",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ef0b27daaa36151550eed2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在试吃会制作拉面时，若诀窍不足，可用<color=#ff911c>隐藏风味秘诀</color>\\n<color=#ff911c>代用不足诀窍</color>！\\n隐藏风味秘诀可<color=#ff911c>通过特定事件获得</color>，但<color=#ff911c>最多仅能持有4个</color>，\\n且<color=#ff911c>单次试吃会最多使用2个</color>，请看准时机使用吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5a72791ba81e11e62f8ae4ee3a7bc0f7a14b042da530c53fc142132d914e733",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "370"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:051ed7e5f3a7e451fc145984",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff911c>每年12月下半回合结束后</color>，为更新次年制作\\n拉面的知识，<color=#ff911c>诀窍持有数将全部重置</color>！\\n取而代之，会<color=#ff911c>根据重置的诀窍数恢复体力</color>！\\n另外，<color=#ff911c>隐藏风味秘诀的持有数不会重置</color>，\\n请仔细斟酌使用时机！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4a2cfa12f80b41cd270b548cd20387ec410d434aac5ebcb5835b97f52d5f1da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7b73dd61f5c7026e7ee39f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff911c>拉面嘉年华</color>，通称<color=#ff911c>RMJ</color>，是赛马娘们将期间内\\n研究的各地拉面招待给大家的活动！\\n<color=#ff911c>盛况度</color>越高，活动就<color=#ff911c>越热闹</color>，根据盛况度，\\n赛马娘也能获得更好的成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67c2724e7ac9924b81482e5835a5b210b6ae69db1dc69ff9a8b5c175b5ac8bb7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c3152dbc2b3c44dda08685",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开始夏季合宿时，可获得<color=#ff911c>2个隐藏风味秘诀</color>！\\n此外，夏季合宿期间<color=#ff911c>每回合可额外获得1个</color>隐藏风味秘诀，\\n期间请积极执行试吃会，\\n从而让训练变得更高效吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38dd2c523e03a5e4d6a4f8d830f8c98031559dc11b755c8eeb7fb29c5475087f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "373"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52d23a8c341dccc5564e183e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过消耗专用道具<color=#ff911c>能力Pt</color>，\\n可以发动具有各种对育成有益效果的<color=#ff911c>训练员能力</color>，\\n并在<color=#ff911c>一定时间内</color>生效。\\n配合育成目的发动合适的能力，\\n来培育赛马娘吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a68bc35ff25a76cff4484a3e1e4ba8ab7c2115a1bc6de4673a0f4816ce5f9c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "374"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b32e065afd4b7195fc76354",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以在最终确认弹窗的标签页中，切换「常规育成」与「自主训练育成」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "381f3d9a687dcb8faaa35a14990a0ab3a003de008111e275bc3f5a70d984d14c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "378"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7dd420b60a4cc1901563a90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "收集与赛马娘有关的记录，提升<color=#ff9900>名鉴Lv</color>吧。\\n根据育成中的历代评价点、阅览过的故事等\\n可以积累名鉴Exp，名鉴Lv上升后可以获得报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e19e71a3bb7989a0b6c8e756a4db76aad3626bbd860cdc953baaa83d93147e8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dc739c126759fa4c22a1b95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能力Pt除了训练通行证外，还可通过各类活动\\n获得。\\n此外，在训练通行证中购买高级通行证，\\n将能够获得更多的能力Pt。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b71bcd060920d2e00c0bfca01e32e4b3d58f59de85697f2362d0a1b2d594bda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "383"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:733131b54ad91d487152d295",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "瞄准目标抓取嘚嘚玩偶（ぱかプチ）吧！\\n挑战次数<color=#ff9900>3次</color>内只要获得一个便为成功。\\n若成功，赛马娘将可能获得<color=#ff9900>新的折扣</color>！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57d7bd70792f2cc7da8760b401beabb7b39a767ac159ffdb611c050485a2cf94",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1a1648a489535d2e062279",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "继承<color=#ff9900>心意（因子）</color>吧。\\n育成开始时能力或适性将提高，\\n育成时的<color=#ff9900>继承事件</color>中赛马娘也将成长。\\n被继承的殿堂赛马娘不会消失，\\n所以为了育成出更强大的赛马娘，活用继承吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d768b43b72f744b7257ecd53fd3d58f4d918bfa1b15f6be687ac78a24ba26da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd6852dfa5473d653a67471f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "恭喜升级至<color=#ff9900>CLASS2</color>！\\n队伍编组的<color=#ff9900>第2行</color>已解锁。\\n可以编入更多殿堂赛马娘了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f108a4052a08bfbff2f5c99377787ca2068032b267dcdbc22509ebdb975023c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:682b2a66b053d972078f8199",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "恭喜升级至<color=#ff9900>CLASS3</color>！\\n队伍编组的<color=#ff9900>第3行</color>已解锁。\\n可以编入更多殿堂赛马娘了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51f2e2f6f338bff51a65e966e4cf4591705b8e2bdddbc27afe852741aa4e3c5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53e494715a9d7a13a8a73aaf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成中，在每名赛马娘设定的<color=#ff9900>目标比赛</color>中\\n努力取得好成绩。要在比赛中取得优异的成绩\\n需要通过<color=#ff9900>训练</color>来<color=#ff9900>提高基础能力</color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f950fcebaa3f4d7a7725aa43ced226cc85e382060a825ec7be34ffd1cb0f969",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67fc74a83a1c029fca34df79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获取的<color=#ff9900>技能</color>，可在<color=#ff9900>比赛</color>中产生<color=#ff9900>各种效果</color>\\n获取技能所需的<color=#ff9900>技能点数</color>主要通过参加比赛获得，\\n在部分事件中也可获得技能点数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25b0e93c60383cf86598b565b1707ac013e9aff188333fdd7d4e92a3126f9885",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09ddee5acaf5753ac6685d0c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>体力过少</color>、<color=#ff9900>干劲低下</color>时，训练和\\n比赛都将无法正常发挥。\\n选择<color=#ff9900>休息</color>来回复体力，选择<color=#ff9900>外出</color>来提升干劲，\\n要多多关注马娘的身体状况哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b18ccb27b6d4a8478670a4bf003dc60162ea63200b6ce0d5f4a29391e05028c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adf36e4950007c38fa1600a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成中，有时会出现能对赛马娘训练和身体状况\\n产生负面影响的<color=#ff9900>状态</color>。\\n在<color=#ff9900>保健室</color>中可以解除负面状态，\\n因此出现负面状态时要尽早前往保健室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6068adacc9389563a268e2bfc2173cc0a94c13c579f71cc7ce5832097714940",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "45"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cae1972495da59839713dd8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行赛马娘育成时可以执行各种指令！\\n均衡地执行各种指令，将您的赛马娘\\n培育为知名赛马娘吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b13cc82d57996f61214d3b15901707816d2cb67c7f241596bda7d4502b0359d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "46"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33a3a7e9a38f7a73ad791211",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "新马级6月后半开始可以参加<color=#ff9900>比赛</color>。\\n好好锻炼你负责的赛马娘，朝着<color=#ff9900>第1名</color>努力吧！\\n根据比赛名次可获得学习技能所需的<color=#ff9900>技能点数</color>和\\n参加大型比赛所需的<color=#ff9900>粉丝数</color>。\\n另外，根据名次和名次差距可随机获得物品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b169a0db7578154d5d97867dabe3e29631da73407dde51b4adf1fef70d359945",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "47"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9f9b122d3fab4e917a7e03f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们将在<color=#ff9900>出道战</color>中首次登上比赛舞台。\\n在出道战获得第1名之后，便可以参加各式\\n比赛。\\n若在出道战中没有获得第1名，那就以其次回合开始的\\n<color=#ff9900>未冠赛</color>的胜利为目标努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae3abc4a6e4a508803c6865dfb936d6aa45e00bf7f0ff38ff2d5796ac73ca335",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "48"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
